{"id":"efe2d4b0294be128","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-lovaszextension.md","title":"Normalized Lovász extension","display":"df-lovaszextension — Normalized Lovász extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-lovaszextension","aliases":["27-df-lovaszextension"],"display":"df-lovaszextension — Normalized Lovász extension","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbpolynomialextension]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.3.3","source_statement":"Definition 13.8, Equation (13.33)","source_printed_pages":"583","source_pdf_pages":"607","verification_status":"source-definition-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-lovaszextension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-lovaszextension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lovaszextension — Normalized Lovász extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c57bdf80f8f006ca\" href=\"?note=c57bdf80f8f006ca\" title=\"27-df-pbpolynomialextension\">27-df-pbpolynomialextension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.3.3"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Definition 13.8, Equation (13.33)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"583"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"607"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0\">\\(f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_f,\\chi_A\">\\(c_f,\\chi_A\\)</span> 经 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c57bdf80f8f006ca\" href=\"?note=c57bdf80f8f006ca\" title=\"27-df-pbpolynomialextension\">27-df-pbpolynomialextension</a> 的上游 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7937ecc11ac59760\" href=\"?note=7937ecc11ac59760\" title=\"27-df-pbcoeff\">27-df-pbcoeff</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span> 经该定义的上游。</p>\n<p>待定义扩张记号：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LovExt}\">\\(\\mathrm{LovExt}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LovExt}(f):U_n\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\mathrm{LovExt}(f)(p)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\varnothing\\neq S\\subseteq N}c_f(S)\\min\\{p_i:i\\in S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LovExt}(f):U_n\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\mathrm{LovExt}(f)(p)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\varnothing\\neq S\\subseteq N}c_f(S)\\min\\{p_i:i\\in S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保持原书 f(0)=0 的归一化前提。求和显式排除空集，修复直接照抄式(13.33)时 c_f(∅)=0 却仍出现 min ∅ 的良定义性隐患；没有以“零系数”掩盖未定义项。n=0 时归一化函数为0，空和定义为0。它与把乘积延伸到实数的 PolExt 通常不同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbpolynomialextension","status":"resolved","id":"c57bdf80f8f006ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbpolynomialextension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbpolynomialextension","status":"resolved","id":"c57bdf80f8f006ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0$；$c_f,\\chi_A$ 经 [[27-df-pbpolynomialextension]] 的上游 [[27-df-pbcoeff]]；$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$U_n$ 经该定义的上游。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbcoeff","status":"resolved","id":"7937ecc11ac59760","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0$；$c_f,\\chi_A$ 经 [[27-df-pbpolynomialextension]] 的上游 [[27-df-pbcoeff]]；$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$U_n$ 经该定义的上游。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0","display":false},{"tex":"c_f,\\chi_A","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LovExt}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LovExt}(f):U_n\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\mathrm{LovExt}(f)(p)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\varnothing\\neq S\\subseteq N}c_f(S)\\min\\{p_i:i\\in S\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1499,"backlinks":[{"id":"7ca316f0d7623463","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"取 $n=2$；$\\mathrm{PolExt},\\mathrm{LovExt}$（see [[27-df-lovaszextension]]），$\\mathrm{LowEnv},\\mathrm{UpEnv}$（see [[27-df-pbenvelopes]]）。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-257","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-lovaszextension|df-lovaszextension — Normalized Lovász extension]]"},{"id":"8749982edf417a9c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0$；$\\mathrm{LovExt}$（see [[27-df-lovaszextension]]），$\\mathrm{Perm}(N),S_\\pi,E_{\\pi,k},t_{\\pi,k},w_{\\pi,k},\\mathrm{AffineOn}$（see [[27-df-cubesimplices]]），$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；规范系数重构（see [[27-thm-pbpoly]]）。"}],"outgoing":["c57bdf80f8f006ca","7937ecc11ac59760"]}